2025-12-27 17:11:55.012565 Event: <class 'pydantic_ai.messages.PartEndEvent'> PartEndEvent(index=1, part=ToolCallPart(tool_name='write_file', args='{"path": "/workspace/intermediate/generate_charts.py", "content": "import pandas as pd\\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\\nimport seaborn as sns\\nimport numpy as np\\nfrom matplotlib.backends.backend_agg import FigureCanvasAgg\\nimport io\\nimport base64\\n\\n# 设置中文字体\\nplt.rcParams[\'font.sans-serif\'] = [\'SimHei\', \'Arial Unicode MS\', \'DejaVu Sans\']\\nplt.rcParams[\'axes.unicode_minus\'] = False\\n\\n# 读取Excel文件\\ndf = pd.read_excel(\'/workspace/uploads/2025年大模型场景汇总.xlsx\')\\n\\n# 创建图表\\nfig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 2, figsize=(15, 12))\\nfig.suptitle(\'2025年大模型场景应用项目分析图表\', fontsize=16)\\n\\n# 1. 项目分类统计饼图\\ntask_categories = df[\'任务分类\'].value_counts()\\naxes[0, 0].pie(task_categories.values, labels=task_categories.index, autopct=\'%1.1f%%\', startangle=90)\\naxes[0, 0].set_title(\'项目分类分布\')\\n\\n# 2. 部门分布柱状图\\ndepartments = df[\'需求提出部门\'].value_counts()\\nbars = axes[0, 1].bar(range(len(departments)), departments.values, color=\'skyblue\')\\naxes[0, 1].set_title(\'各部门项目分布\')\\naxes[0, 1].set_xticks(range(len(departments)))\\naxes[0, 1].set_xticklabels(departments.index, rotation=45, ha=\'right\')\\naxes[0, 1].set_ylabel(\'项目数量\')\\n\\n# 3. 项目进度分布\\nprogress_status = df[\'现在进度\'].value_counts(dropna=False)\\naxes[1, 0].bar(range(len(progress_status)), progress_status.values, color=\'lightgreen\')\\naxes[1, 0].set_title(\'项目进度分布\')\\naxes[1, 0].set_xticks(range(len(progress_status)))\\naxes[1, 0].set_xticklabels(progress_status.index, rotation=45, ha=\'right\')\\naxes[1, 0].set_ylabel(\'项目数量\')\\n\\n# 4. 计划调整与作废情况\\nadjustment_counts = df[\'是否需要调整计划\'].value_counts()\\ncanceled_counts = df[\'是否作废\'].value_counts()\\n\\n# 创建复合柱状图\\nx = np.arange(len(adjustment_counts))\\nwidth = 0.35\\n\\naxes[1, 1].bar(x - width/2, adjustment_counts.values, width, label=\'是否需要调整计划\', color=\'orange\')\\naxes[1, 1].bar(x + width/2, canceled_counts.values, width, label=\'是否作废\', color=\'red\')\\naxes[1, 1].set_title(\'项目调整与作废情况\')\\naxes[1, 1].set_xticks(x)\\naxes[1, 1].set_xticklabels(adjustment_counts.index)\\naxes[1, 1].legend()\\n\\nplt.tight_layout()\\nplt.savefig(\'/workspace/intermediate/project_analysis_charts.png\', dpi=300, bbox_inches=\'tight\')\\nplt.close()\\n\\nprint(\\"图表已生成并保存至 /workspace/intermediate/project_analysis_charts.png\\")"}', tool_call_id='call_2b24f4a8d059487fae30e4eb'))
2025-12-27 17:11:55.018068 Event: <class 'pydantic_ai.messages.FunctionToolCallEvent'> FunctionToolCallEvent(part=ToolCallPart(tool_name='write_file', args='{"path": "/workspace/intermediate/generate_charts.py", "content": "import pandas as pd\\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\\nimport seaborn as sns\\nimport numpy as np\\nfrom matplotlib.backends.backend_agg import FigureCanvasAgg\\nimport io\\nimport base64\\n\\n# 设置中文字体\\nplt.rcParams[\'font.sans-serif\'] = [\'SimHei\', \'Arial Unicode MS\', \'DejaVu Sans\']\\nplt.rcParams[\'axes.unicode_minus\'] = False\\n\\n# 读取Excel文件\\ndf = pd.read_excel(\'/workspace/uploads/2025年大模型场景汇总.xlsx\')\\n\\n# 创建图表\\nfig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 2, figsize=(15, 12))\\nfig.suptitle(\'2025年大模型场景应用项目分析图表\', fontsize=16)\\n\\n# 1. 项目分类统计饼图\\ntask_categories = df[\'任务分类\'].value_counts()\\naxes[0, 0].pie(task_categories.values, labels=task_categories.index, autopct=\'%1.1f%%\', startangle=90)\\naxes[0, 0].set_title(\'项目分类分布\')\\n\\n# 2. 部门分布柱状图\\ndepartments = df[\'需求提出部门\'].value_counts()\\nbars = axes[0, 1].bar(range(len(departments)), departments.values, color=\'skyblue\')\\naxes[0, 1].set_title(\'各部门项目分布\')\\naxes[0, 1].set_xticks(range(len(departments)))\\naxes[0, 1].set_xticklabels(departments.index, rotation=45, ha=\'right\')\\naxes[0, 1].set_ylabel(\'项目数量\')\\n\\n# 3. 项目进度分布\\nprogress_status = df[\'现在进度\'].value_counts(dropna=False)\\naxes[1, 0].bar(range(len(progress_status)), progress_status.values, color=\'lightgreen\')\\naxes[1, 0].set_title(\'项目进度分布\')\\naxes[1, 0].set_xticks(range(len(progress_status)))\\naxes[1, 0].set_xticklabels(progress_status.index, rotation=45, ha=\'right\')\\naxes[1, 0].set_ylabel(\'项目数量\')\\n\\n# 4. 计划调整与作废情况\\nadjustment_counts = df[\'是否需要调整计划\'].value_counts()\\ncanceled_counts = df[\'是否作废\'].value_counts()\\n\\n# 创建复合柱状图\\nx = np.arange(len(adjustment_counts))\\nwidth = 0.35\\n\\naxes[1, 1].bar(x - width/2, adjustment_counts.values, width, label=\'是否需要调整计划\', color=\'orange\')\\naxes[1, 1].bar(x + width/2, canceled_counts.values, width, label=\'是否作废\', color=\'red\')\\naxes[1, 1].set_title(\'项目调整与作废情况\')\\naxes[1, 1].set_xticks(x)\\naxes[1, 1].set_xticklabels(adjustment_counts.index)\\naxes[1, 1].legend()\\n\\nplt.tight_layout()\\nplt.savefig(\'/workspace/intermediate/project_analysis_charts.png\', dpi=300, bbox_inches=\'tight\')\\nplt.close()\\n\\nprint(\\"图表已生成并保存至 /workspace/intermediate/project_analysis_charts.png\\")"}', tool_call_id='call_2b24f4a8d059487fae30e4eb'))
