 <div class="card">\n            <h3>Go 最佳实践</h3>\n            <ul>\n                <li>使用 Worker Pool 模式管理并发</li>\n                <li>合理使用 Context 控制超时和取消</li>\n                <li>避免共享内存，使用 Channel 通信</li>\n                <li>使用 WaitGroup 等待任务完成</li>\n            </ul>\n            \n            <div class="code-block language-go">\n                // Worker Pool 模式<br>\n                func workerPool(jobs <-chan Job, results chan<- Result, numWorkers int) {<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;var wg sync.WaitGroup<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;for i := 0; i < numWorkers; i++ {<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;wg.Add(1)<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;go func() {<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;defer wg.Done()<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;for job := range jobs {<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;// 处理任务<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;results <- process(job)<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}()<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;}<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;wg.Wait()<br>\n                }\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class="card">\n            <h3>Python 最佳实践</h3>\n            <ul>\n                <li>使用 asyncio.Semaphore 控制并发数量</li>\n                <li>合理使用 asyncio.gather() 并发执行</li>\n                <li>利用异步上下文管理器</li>\n                <li>结合 aiohttp 等异步库</li>\n            </ul>\n            \n            <div class="code-block language-python">\n                # 控制并发数<br>\n                semaphore = asyncio.Semaphore(10)  # 最多10个并发<br>\n                <br>\n                async def limited_fetch(session, url):<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;async with semaphore:<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;async with session.get(url) as response:<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;return await response.text()<br>\n                <br>\n                # 处理完成的任务<br>\n                async def process_urls(urls):<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;async with aiohttp.ClientSession() as session:<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;tasks = [limited_fetch(session, url) for url in urls]<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;for coro in asyncio.as_completed(tasks):<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;result = await coro<br>\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;print(f"Completed: {result}")\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class="conclusion">\n        <h2>总结与建议</h2>\n        <p><strong>Go 语言更适合：</strong></p>\n        <ul>\n            <li>需要极高并发性能的场景</li>\n            <li>微服务架构和分布式系统</li>\n            <li>实时系统和高吞吐量应用</li>\n            <li>对内存开销敏感的应用</li>\n        </ul>\n        \n        <p><strong>Python 语言更适合：</strong></p>\n        <ul>\n            <li>快速原型开发和实验</li>\n            <li>Web 应用和 API 服务</li>\n            <li>数据处理和科学计算</li>\n            <li>已有同步代码需要异步改造</li>\n        </ul>\n        \n        <p>选择哪种语言的异步实现主要取决于项目的具体需求、团队的技术栈以及性能要求。</p>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>'))
