2025-12-30 16:56:48.878320 Event: <class 'pydantic_ai.messages.PartEndEvent'> PartEndEvent(index=1, part=ToolCallPart(tool_name='execute', args='{"command": "cd /workspace/intermediate && python -c \\"\\nimport markdown\\nfrom docx import Document\\nfrom PIL import Image\\nimport os\\n\\n# 读取Markdown文件\\nwith open(\'问题分析报告.md\', \'r\', encoding=\'utf-8\') as f:\\n    md_content = f.read()\\n\\n# 创建Word文档\\ndoc = Document()\\n\\n# 添加标题\\ndoc.add_heading(\'昆小智问题分析报告\', 0)\\n\\n# 解析并添加内容\\nlines = md_content.split(\'\\\\n\')\\ncurrent_section = None\\n\\nfor line in lines:\\n    if line.startswith(\'# \'):\\n        doc.add_heading(line[2:], level=1)\\n    elif line.startswith(\'## \'):\\n        doc.add_heading(line[3:], level=2)\\n    elif line.startswith(\'### \'):\\n        doc.add_heading(line[4:], level=3)\\n    elif line.startswith(\'![\') and \'](\' in line:\\n        # 处理图片\\n        alt_text = line.split(\']\')[0][2:]\\n        img_path = line.split(\'(\')[1].split(\')\')[0]\\n        try:\\n            doc.add_picture(img_path, width=docx.shared.Inches(6))\\n            doc.add_paragraph(alt_text)\\n        except Exception as e:\\n            print(f\'图片插入失败: {e}\')\\n    elif line.strip() == \'\':\\n        continue\\n    else:\\n        doc.add_paragraph(line)\\n\\n# 保存文档\\ndoc.save(\'昆小智问题分析报告.docx\')\\nprint(\'Word文档已生成：昆小智问题分析报告.docx\')\\n\\""}', tool_call_id='call_10912c2675fb47479721a307'))
2025-12-30 16:56:48.880046 Event: <class 'pydantic_ai.messages.FunctionToolCallEvent'> FunctionToolCallEvent(part=ToolCallPart(tool_name='execute', args='{"command": "cd /workspace/intermediate && python -c \\"\\nimport markdown\\nfrom docx import Document\\nfrom PIL import Image\\nimport os\\n\\n# 读取Markdown文件\\nwith open(\'问题分析报告.md\', \'r\', encoding=\'utf-8\') as f:\\n    md_content = f.read()\\n\\n# 创建Word文档\\ndoc = Document()\\n\\n# 添加标题\\ndoc.add_heading(\'昆小智问题分析报告\', 0)\\n\\n# 解析并添加内容\\nlines = md_content.split(\'\\\\n\')\\ncurrent_section = None\\n\\nfor line in lines:\\n    if line.startswith(\'# \'):\\n        doc.add_heading(line[2:], level=1)\\n    elif line.startswith(\'## \'):\\n        doc.add_heading(line[3:], level=2)\\n    elif line.startswith(\'### \'):\\n        doc.add_heading(line[4:], level=3)\\n    elif line.startswith(\'![\') and \'](\' in line:\\n        # 处理图片\\n        alt_text = line.split(\']\')[0][2:]\\n        img_path = line.split(\'(\')[1].split(\')\')[0]\\n        try:\\n            doc.add_picture(img_path, width=docx.shared.Inches(6))\\n            doc.add_paragraph(alt_text)\\n        except Exception as e:\\n            print(f\'图片插入失败: {e}\')\\n    elif line.strip() == \'\':\\n        continue\\n    else:\\n        doc.add_paragraph(line)\\n\\n# 保存文档\\ndoc.save(\'昆小智问题分析报告.docx\')\\nprint(\'Word文档已生成：昆小智问题分析报告.docx\')\\n\\""}', tool_call_id='call_10912c2675fb47479721a307'))
